=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/tethers-excess-reserves-nearly-double-to-8b-as-q3-profit-hits-15b?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tether\u2019s excess reserves nearly double to $8B as Q3 profit hits $1.5B</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
